Package: ubigeocensos
Type: Package
Title: Peruvian Territorial Units in the 1981-2025 Population Censuses
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alejandro", "Pérez Portocarrero",
           email = "alejandroperezportocarrero@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Datasets of the departments, provinces and districts of Peru,
    identified by their 2025 UBIGEO (INEI) code, with their creation date and
    legal instrument of creation, their presence and code in the national
    population censuses of 1981, 1993, 2007, 2017 and 2025, their population
    by sex and area in each census, and a crosswalk of census codes to 2025
    with harmonised units. Intended to help harmonise census data across years
    and to account for the creation of new districts.
